WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:05.150
So yes we back with that JJK heat, time to
go over ‘the I actually cant believe it,

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.910
12th arc In Gege Akutami’s beast of a series
that is Jujutsu Kaisen.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:12.330
Ofcourse, If you are new around here and want
to watch more long form explained content

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:14.860
just like this where I cover a plethora of
different stuff from a variety of manga, then

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.900
remember to subscribe and leave a like down
below as it really does help out with pushing

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.640
my content to a bunch of new amazing people!

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:25.440
Anyways enough of me rambling on lets get
into the one and only Sakurajima Colony from

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:27.730
Jujutsu Kaisens Culling Game.

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:32.730
So remember how right at the end of the last
JJK arc we found the Monster herself, Maki

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.410
in Sakurajima Colony.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.300
Well after effortlessly dispatching the toughest
cursed spirits and players.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:41.520
She runs into Noritoshi Kamo, who has undergone
a clean as hell looking transformation.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:45.340
Man literally had to switch his look up after
realizing he’s named after the worst sorcerer

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:46.860
in their families history.

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:50.930
Anyways, They both acknowledge the changes
in each other, with Noritoshi confessing that

00:00:50.930 --> 00:00:55.360
he's lost his position as the Kamo family
heir and has fallen from grace, while Maki

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.020
has become formidable.

00:00:57.020 --> 00:01:01.022
Noritoshi asks Maki to meet with Ui Ui once
she leaves the Colony (as remember she can

00:01:01.022 --> 00:01:05.150
because of her recent transformation can freely
travel between colonies), but suddenly their

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:09.140
plans are disrupted by the sudden appearance
of a formidable cursed spirit.

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:13.450
As it enters, shooting in through the barrier
it disregards Kogane's request to become a

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:18.300
player, telling it to shut up.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:21.970
Going into a moment that happened in the days
prior, we find a hurried Noritoshi rushing

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:26.570
through the house searching for people until
he comes face to face with a senile Shino.

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:30.189
BTW anyone notice that dramatic change (well
its not dramatic is been slowly added in)

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:32.800
but, in Gege’s art from the beginning of
the culling game?

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:38.149
Like its gone from this very I guess you could
say, this plain Shounen style to a now scratchy

00:01:38.149 --> 00:01:41.700
dark type of art thats truly adding to the
growing horrible feel of this world.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:42.700
ANYWAYS!

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:46.430
The Senile old dog asks how the Kamo got in,
claiming that ever since the guard was taken

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:49.050
over its become completely useless.

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:52.770
Noritoshi tells the old fart he doesn't have
any time for jokes, but Shino eerily ask’s

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:56.830
him if he’s forgotten who’s actually the
next head of the family...

00:01:56.830 --> 00:02:01.289
As he continues spouting more bizarre nonsense,
a worried Noritoshi presses on and enters

00:02:01.289 --> 00:02:02.300
the house.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:06.829
Inside, he is greeted by the body swapping
creep himself, Kenjaku, who’s literally

00:02:06.829 --> 00:02:10.530
just chilling out and relaxing as he was waiting
for Noritoshi to arrive.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:15.080
Kenjaku greets Noritoshi with a smile and
offers to fill him in on his plans.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:19.440
He explains how he used Jujutsu terrorism,
the sealing of Saturo Gojo and the culling

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:23.280
game to eliminate the uncorrupted members.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:27.370
He knew that because Gakuganji is considered
trustworthy and has influence with the said

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.890
higher ups, Noritoshi would have wanted to
plead with him in an attempt to retract the

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:33.260
notices from the headquarters.

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:43.340
So he took care of everyone who wasn't on
his side, like Gojo, Gakuganji, Masamichi

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:46.400
and others we probably never actually meet.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.459
btw the actual text goes over how this in
a much more confusing way where they explain

00:02:50.459 --> 00:02:55.250
that pretty much Kenjaku managed to take over
the conservative faction of the Jujutsu World.

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:56.250
Anyways

00:02:56.250 --> 00:03:00.150
Kenjaku’s left impressed, as Noritoshi’s
only a mere student but can already see the

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:02.590
bigger picture and acts how he needs too.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:07.620
Utterly let down, Noritoshi asks Kenjaku if
he’s already removed the people responsible

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:12.000
for initiating Suguru Geto’s execution,
to which its confirmed along with the person

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.519
who named Yuta as Yuji’s executioner.

00:03:14.519 --> 00:03:19.410
Chuckling at Noritoshi's efforts to approach
Gakuganji and fix everything, Kenjaku confidently

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:25.080
exclaims that the Kamo clan was the conservatives
seat, but now it utterly belongs to him along

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:28.680
with the title of the 25th family head!

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:32.689
Feeling challenged, Noritoshi sparks up in
preparation to battle, but Kenjaku quickly

00:03:32.689 --> 00:03:37.650
waves to dismiss him, like man literally laughs
at him and is like nah bro chill.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:41.239
Confused, Noritoshi ask’s what the hell
he’s on, but Kenjaku just tells him that

00:03:41.239 --> 00:03:44.849
its fine because even if he is alive, simply
nothing is going to change.

00:03:44.849 --> 00:03:49.580
PLUSS he dont wanna mess up the new house,
he tells him to instead get lost, allowing

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:53.200
Noritoshi to eventually make his way to where
we found him at the very beginning of this

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.200
arc!

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:57.750
Back in Sakurajima, Noritoshi and Maki are
on high alert as they both spot a supposed

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.439
cursed spirit chilling above them in the sky.

00:04:00.439 --> 00:04:03.850
Looking at it, Maki just has this weird and
uncanny feeling.

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:07.599
INSTANTLY approaching them at lightning speed,
the cursed spirit rampages towards Maki, tearing

00:04:07.599 --> 00:04:10.791
up and utterly obliterating everything in
its path.

00:04:10.791 --> 00:04:13.860
It connects with a blocking Maki, sending
her crashing back and allowing the disgusting

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:16.449
amalgamation of a cursed spirit to pin her
against a cliff.

00:04:16.449 --> 00:04:20.669
Not having even seen this happen, Noritoshi
watches as Maki struggles to break free.

00:04:20.669 --> 00:04:23.889
She attempts to hit it, but the cursed spirit's
speed is too much for her to handle as it

00:04:23.889 --> 00:04:28.310
dodges out of the way and sends her shooting
into nearby cliff face completely deforming

00:04:28.310 --> 00:04:29.310
it.

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:34.860
Despite being at a disadvantage, Maki refuses
to give up sensing something weird.

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:38.720
With determination in her eyes, she quickly
dodges out of the way of the monsters thundering

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:43.170
right hook, however the curse manages to flick
its snakey behind around destroying a few

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:46.300
tree’s in its wake and trapping the sorcerer
up against the cliff.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:51.240
Emerging from the head of the cursed spirit,
no one other than the mysoginistic goon himself,

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:55.830
Naoya Zenin now re-incarnated as a terrifyingly
strong cursed spirit reveals himself.

00:04:55.830 --> 00:05:01.340
Pinned up against the wall, Maki’s just
left left stunned asking if its actually him,

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:05.240
with her older sibling replying that he’s
arrived at the other side!

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.820
Of course if any of you are confused on how
the man himself managed to come back, well

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:09.820
it makes perfect sense.

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:12.199
Maki thought she took out her brother with
a weapon that was made up of her sister, or

00:05:12.199 --> 00:05:14.130
in other words she thought he was killed with
Jujutsu.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:15.410
Yet as we know, but she wasn't privy too,
Naoya was actually merked by Maki’s mother

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.840
wielding a plane stake knife.

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:21.070
So because he wasn't killed with Jujutsu,
it resulted in him coming back as a special

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:22.070
grade curse spirit.

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:23.070
As explained earlier on in the series, sorcerers
have the possibility to re-incarnate as extremely

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:24.070
powerful cursed spirits after death if not
killed with Jujutsu techniques.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.070
BUT enough of me rambling on about why this
fight makes sense.

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:26.070
Ahhhhhhhh Idk even know why I write these
scripts without reading the next chapter sometimes,

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:29.150
like literally right now we jump on in to
another flashback that takes.

00:05:29.150 --> 00:05:33.280
This time between Noritoshi and Gakuganji,
where they talk about Itadori’s recent death...

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:37.720
Sitting there, Gakuganji asks what to keep
in mind while killing a sorcerer, to which

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:42.810
Kamo like I just mentioned responds that they
must be eliminated using Jujutsu.

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:46.840
The story then shifts to Sakurajima Colony,
where Naoya still has Maki pinned up against

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:51.180
the wall, his face continuing to push even
further out of the curses shell.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:54.590
Quickly, Maki comes to the realization that
because she doesn't have cursed energy she

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:57.830
failed to finish Naoya off in their pervious
fight.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:02.550
However, Naoya denies it telling Maki that
she simply just doesn't understand, and instead

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.699
claims it was her mother who finished him
off.

00:06:04.699 --> 00:06:10.120
While Maki’s left shocked, Naoya takes advantage
of the situation and declares that he’s

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.220
returned to completely end her!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:16.160
Luckily for our Queen though, Big Noritoshi
blasts off a shot from his cursed tool allowing

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:18.419
Maki to escape the grasp of the cursed spirit.

00:06:18.419 --> 00:06:24.530
Darting away, she thanks him, but also asks
if he only used his intuition to aim.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:28.990
Nearby in the woods, Noritoshi getting reading
for another shot is easily able to deduce

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:31.180
Naoya’s location through the curses presence.

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:35.290
However, he notes that deducing Maki's location
is a bit more difficult which is obviously

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:45.980
because the only energy coming off her is
the jujutsu emanating from sword she wields.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:49.849
Finally shooting off his 3 arrows technique,
Noritoshi is able to expertly navigate all

00:06:49.849 --> 00:06:54.080
his arrows around trees and other obstacles
on their way towards the cursed Naoya.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:58.370
Spotting the arrows bursting through the tree’s,
the cursed spirit mocks the arrows and their

00:06:58.370 --> 00:06:59.370
pathetic speed.

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:02.639
Taking the monster by surprise though, Maki
grabs ahold of him, then using the momentum

00:07:02.639 --> 00:07:07.210
from his massive size, sends him flying directly
into the path of the arrows, which penetrate

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:09.050
deeply into his body.

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:13.560
As Naoya screams in pain, Maki immediately
pulls up and slices him in half with her cursed

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:14.560
tool...

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:18.919
From a distance Noritoshi watches as Maki
falls onto the buildings below her while wondering

00:07:18.919 --> 00:07:22.280
to himself if she actually managed to exorcise
Naoya.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:26.710
To their shock though, our highschooler duo
are left helpless, only able to watch as Naoya’s

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.380
cursed spirit explodes, before collapsing
in on itself like some kinda cursed energy

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:31.610
dark hole.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:35.919
Seeing this happen in the sky above her, Maki
begins to recognize what's actually happening.

00:07:35.919 --> 00:07:39.610
As it fully begins forming into a ball of
energy, she screams out to Noritoshi telling

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:43.400
him to shoot at it, as she knows its a cursed
womb thats currently evolving.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:47.961
To prevent disaster and just looking hella
clean, like im loving the knew drip, Noritoshi

00:07:47.961 --> 00:07:52.940
immediately destroys a blood bad then uses
his cursed technique, Piercing Blood, to stop

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:54.860
Naoya from completing his transformation.

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:59.729
The beam of blood pierces directly through
Naoya’s cursed womb causing a flood of blood

00:07:59.729 --> 00:08:02.020
to begin pouring out.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:06.050
Thinking that he exorcized the cursed womb,
Noritoshi watches as the burning ball begins

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:07.259
falling to the ground below.

00:08:07.259 --> 00:08:11.810
Yet, as he begins to ponder how insanely fast
it could've been if it survived, its revealed

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:17.050
that Naoya did indeed dodge the attack and
has evolved into a much more terrifying form.

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:20.720
Maki screams for him to dodge, but before
Noritoshi even has time to react, he’s hit

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:24.569
with a devastating blow that sends him rocketing
back through the forest around them.

00:08:24.569 --> 00:08:28.580
Turning around and calling Noritoshi utter
trash, we see the grotesque and harrowing

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:33.669
sight of Naoya's full transformation into
a foul, repulsive cursed spirit.

00:08:33.669 --> 00:08:37.400
Noticing that he managed to defend himself
from the attack, Naoya states that Noritoshi

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.979
is indeed a clan head after all.

00:08:39.979 --> 00:08:43.550
As Kamo sits there recovering from the blow,
its explained that if he hadn't of used his

00:08:43.550 --> 00:08:46.140
blood to block the previous blow he would
have died.

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:50.500
Getting back to his feet and with a revived
look of determination on his face, he activates

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:54.500
his flowing red scale ability to attack the
quickly approaching curse.

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:58.681
Seeing the curse approaching Noritoshi, Maki
rushes over and manages to jump infront of

00:08:58.681 --> 00:09:02.120
him, before diving straight towards the curse
and cutting him in open with her blade.

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:05.680
Watching this happen infront of him, the juiced
up Noritoshi activates his crimson binding

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:10.000
technique, restraining the cursed spirit and
allowing Maki to strike at him once more.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:14.579
Yet just as her swing is about to land, Naoya
spun at a high velocity to deflect her strike

00:09:14.579 --> 00:09:16.370
completely catching Maki by surprise.

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:20.440
Their combined efforts prove to be utterly
ineffective against Naoya, who still retains

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.490
his ego from his previous life.

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:26.870
Getting ready to re-engage, Maki states that
he can still use his cursed technique which

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.270
explains why he’s been so monstrously fast.

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:34.279
In retaliation, Naoya unleashes his prolific
Projection Sorcery sending out a bunch of

00:09:34.279 --> 00:09:39.760
frames in Maki’s direction freezing anything
that he touches which in this regard is literally

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:41.150
the air between the two.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:45.100
As he instantly touches the set of frames
it creates a devastating explosion that Maki

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.519
and Noritoshi barely dodge.

00:09:47.519 --> 00:09:52.170
Undeterred, Naoya takes off at a speed faster
than sound, confusing Noritoshi who wonders

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:57.440
if he’s fleeing but Maki corrects him stating
that he’s actually just speeding up.

00:09:57.440 --> 00:10:01.269
As Naoya if off boosting around, the duo discuss
what they’re going to do now, to which Maki

00:10:01.269 --> 00:10:04.279
says that if he’s going to approach them
at the speed of sound, then they can lye in

00:10:04.279 --> 00:10:06.959
wait and deliverer a killing blow.

00:10:06.959 --> 00:10:10.950
Sensing the curses direction change towards
them, Maki bravely steps forward to face Naoya

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:15.240
head-on telling her companion to stay back
as Noritoshi activates his technique around

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.579
her in an attempt to add some protection.

00:10:17.579 --> 00:10:21.839
With the curse spirit destroying every shard
of glass as it builds up speed, its explained

00:10:21.839 --> 00:10:25.850
to us that this mysoginistic demon of a curse
brings air in through these inlets on its

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:30.720
back and compresses it along with cursed energy
to then eject it for even more speed.

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:35.750
With his max speed of freaking MACH 3 achieved,
Naoya strikes with such a devastating force

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:39.800
that it leaves Maki almost completely unconscious
and badly injured.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:44.459
Standing above her now, Naoya mocks Maki,
disgusted with himself to ever think her lost

00:10:44.459 --> 00:10:45.459
to her.

00:10:45.459 --> 00:10:47.550
Manically standing above his cousin, Naoya
states that this indeed takes him back.

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:52.029
There are things children can never do that
adults easily overcome, after you grow up

00:10:52.029 --> 00:10:55.110
you don't even remember the times were you
constantly failed.

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:59.240
Laughing at this stupidity of his though,
Maki mockingly asks him when was he ever an

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:04.970
actual adult to which Naoya evilly tells her
that she should ask her dead sister...

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:09.560
Fuming with anger over how her sister was
disrespected, Maki swiftly stands, and in

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:14.350
perfect coordination with her, Noritoshi unleashes
two more arrows into the malevolent entity.

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:18.240
Darting in behind, Noritoshi then employs
his blood bending technique, slicing into

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:22.410
the curse and landing a devastating blow leaving
it stunned with the amount of blood being

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.300
expended by the sorcerer.

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:27.830
Coming to tho he makes the connection that
Noritoshi could possibly be circulating the

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:32.050
blood outside of his body and then bringing
it back in continuously, that way he wont

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:33.490
die of blood loss.

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:37.420
Knowing that only Maki can defeat him, Noritoshi
tells his companion that he’ll hold off

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:42.579
Naoya while she makes a run for it, but Maki
refuses.

00:11:42.579 --> 00:11:45.839
Noritoshi argues though that she’s probably
suffered internal damage and just a brief

00:11:45.839 --> 00:11:50.100
break wont be enough, yet still Maki denies
it, she tells him that she isn't bluffing

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.459
and really does just need 5 minutes to fully
heal her injuries.

00:11:53.459 --> 00:12:00.850
Idk how she’s healing herself someone please
let me know down below, but either way Maki

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:02.550
commands Noritoshi to just survive for five
minutes.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:06.090
Hearing this, he tells her that he wont make
any promises as honestly it doesn't really

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:08.620
matter whether he lives or dies.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:13.170
Re-igniting the battle, Naoya blasts towards
the duo but Noritoshi uses another technique

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:17.310
to form a blood fence before diving out of
the way as Naoya effortlessly bursts through

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:18.310
it.

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:19.920
Noticing that Maki has vanished he asks where
she is as because of the fact she’s like

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:23.710
Toji he cant sense her.

00:12:23.710 --> 00:12:28.850
Noritoshi analyzes the situation and realizes
that although Naoya's curse body is incredibly

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.470
fast, it's not very durable.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:34.290
He also observes that Naoya has a binding
vow that requires him to curl up at high speeds

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.148
to avoid tearing, thus increasing his toughness,
but leaves him vulnerable when not moving

00:12:36.148 --> 00:12:37.148
at top speed.

00:12:37.148 --> 00:12:38.148
Thinking to himself, Noritoshi surmises that
Naoya’s curse is insanely fast but in terms

00:12:38.148 --> 00:12:39.148
of durability he’s comparable to Hanami.

00:12:39.148 --> 00:12:40.148
He also has to curl up at top speeds to prevent
himself from tearing up which greatly increases

00:12:40.148 --> 00:12:41.148
his toughness, but due to that binding vow
itself when not moving at high speeds he’s

00:12:41.148 --> 00:12:42.148
extremely vulnerable.

00:12:42.148 --> 00:12:45.850
All of a sudden striking faster than the speed
of sound, Noritoshi is completely taken off

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:50.010
Guard and blown back through a bunch of defenseless
tree’s by Naoya’s blow.

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:53.550
Immediately following up, the mysoginistic
demon speeds up and rams straight into the

00:12:53.550 --> 00:12:56.899
vulnerable sorcerer causing him to start spewing
out blood.

00:12:56.899 --> 00:13:01.089
With Noritoshi falling towards the ground
below, Naoya gives chase and jokes that blowing

00:13:01.089 --> 00:13:04.160
blood in his inlet was a dirty move.

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:08.120
However, Noritoshi refuses to give up and
claps his hands together, delivering a powerful

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:10.420
blood beam straight to Naoya's head.

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:15.870
Despite his efforts, Naoya remains unfazed
and declares the battle to be over, causing

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:20.980
Noritoshi to fall into a childhood flashback,
so you know big Kamo’s having his life flash

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.290
before his eyes frfr.

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:26.550
He believes that honestly he’s failed, he
was never able to create a safe place for

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:28.320
his broken family.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:33.019
Coming back to reality, he now see’s the
malevolent figure that is Naoya leaning over

00:13:33.019 --> 00:13:34.180
him.

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:39.889
Again Noritoshi is hit by the shell of Naoya’s
curse sending him a few feet back, but the

00:13:39.889 --> 00:13:42.829
sorcerer quickly regains his footing.

00:13:42.829 --> 00:13:46.889
Knowing that no one in his personal life needs
him anymore Noritoshi attempts to retaliate

00:13:46.889 --> 00:13:51.560
with a straight punch while proudly stating
that now its time to completely burn his life

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:55.690
away then one day in the future his comrades
can do the same apon his fallen ashes.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:14:00.610
(Honestly Gege chill mane you’re turning
into a bit of poet :o).

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:05.670
Just as Naoya is about to step forth and end
Noritoshi’s life, two new random ass players

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:09.240
screaming Sumo and Katana arrive to join the
fight.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:12.660
So that random man screaming for a Katana
is actually an older schooler who goes by

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.130
the name Daido Hagane.

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:17.709
Like the Sumo dude he’s been summoned into
the current time period, but right in the

00:14:17.709 --> 00:14:20.350
middle of the Kagoshima Sakurajima colony.

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:24.850
He searched far and wide, night and day looking
for a beloved Katana, until one day while

00:14:24.850 --> 00:14:29.269
searching through an abandoned childs room
he finds a Kimetsu No Yaiba First Form Water

00:14:29.269 --> 00:14:32.120
Surface Slash Sword hidden away in a box.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:36.650
On the other hand and also on November the
second, the other culling game player Miyo

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:40.320
Rokujushi who was just summoned, walked around
and challenged everyone he came across for

00:14:40.320 --> 00:14:41.320
Sumo.

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:45.149
He challenged every man, woman, and even a
damn dog, but no one accepted his challenge.

00:14:45.149 --> 00:14:49.500
In the end as he walked around broken hearted,
he heard the phrase Nokotta and immediately

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:53.940
smashed in the granny’s door to see game
of Sumo taking place on the television.

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:57.800
Finally happy with finding that good stuff,
he asked for a location and was told that

00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:01.120
the fight was happening in Ryogoku Tokyo.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:05.380
Actually love how smooth brain looking this
dude is, Peak Gege meme character.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:13.240
Anyways, mans like hmmmm Ryogoku in Tokyo
the capital of the east, but he was wrong

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:17.470
with directions, went right and eventually
strolled into the Sakurajima Colony becoming

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.269
a culling game player.

00:15:19.269 --> 00:15:23.100
With Noritoshi initially taken off guard by
the new people showing up, Naoya takes advantage

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:27.330
of the situation by sending some tentacles
his way, yet our girl quickly shows back up

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:29.450
and cuts off the attacking arm.

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:33.730
Seeing the weapon Maki wields, Daido screams
for her Katana and runs in her directions

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:36.209
continuing to scream and cry for her sword.

00:15:36.209 --> 00:15:39.889
Knowing that the battle’s come to a bit
of a stalemate, Maki threw her Katana towards

00:15:39.889 --> 00:15:45.490
the old man in hope that an external piece
to this fight would alter its outcome.

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:49.779
INSTANTLY as the old geezers fingers touch
the hilt of Maki’s Katana and grab ahold,

00:15:49.779 --> 00:15:53.470
all four players, felt an overwhelming presence
of power emanate from him.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:58.050
It was not cursed energy but an overpowering
presence of sheer lethality, like a brutal

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:00.570
master of death standing before them.

00:16:00.570 --> 00:16:05.630
Its said that this Daido is the reincarnation
of a nameless unmatched swordsman who fights

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:14.589
only with his swordsmanship and not with cursed
energy.

00:16:14.589 --> 00:16:18.820
Slicing at the curse, Naoya is just barely
able to dodge out of the way.

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:22.550
Randomly though the ancient Samurai gets annoyed
at the Katana not actually listening to him

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:25.680
and begins yelling at it asking if it was
trying to shame him.

00:16:25.680 --> 00:16:30.160
Like Maki, Daido also has no cursed energy
and cannot see the curses, so because of that

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:33.870
he asks if there's some kinda Ayakashi infront
of him.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:37.569
Confused as Maki assumed he could see it,
she asks if he cant, to which he explains

00:16:37.569 --> 00:16:40.930
that if you can see everything else besides
the cursed spirit, then isn’t that technically

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:42.830
the same as seeing it.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:46.290
Once finishing his sentence he brings the
blade down connecting directly with Naoya

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:49.720
slashing him in half and taking him completely
by surprise.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:53.060
Blown away with what she just witnessed, Maki
trys to understand how she couldn’t land

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:57.709
any lethal attacks on Naoya but Daido easily
could under the same conditions.

00:16:57.709 --> 00:17:01.790
She ponders what it is that she isn't seeing
and what if there’s still some difference

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:03.390
between her and Toji.

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:07.089
In the end, Maki senses a simple domain appear
behind her.

00:17:07.089 --> 00:17:11.240
Turning around she’s challenged by Miyo
with a Sumo bout.

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:14.720
Maki decides to enter his simple domain and
notes that it only functions when he wants

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:15.720
to do Sumo.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:18.959
Its an extremely simple barrier focused on
only one thing.

00:17:18.959 --> 00:17:23.110
So you know how he was rolling around previous
to this asking people for Sumo matches, well

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:27.500
its because during his Pure Sumo bout, both
the challenger and opponent must agree to

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:29.450
a match to complete his domain.

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:33.940
Due to this Miyo asks Maki for a bout or if
she's like everyone else and is going to refuse

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.070
to do Sumo.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:40.090
To Noritoshi’s annoyance though Maki nonchalantly
ends up agreeing to take part in the bout.

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:44.630
With a massive open grin appearing on his
face, Miyo finally achieves bliss and his

00:17:44.630 --> 00:17:46.940
Domain begins surrounding them both.

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:51.770
Confused as to why, Noritoshi asks what she
was thinking but Maki actually responds that

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:55.450
she was infact overthinking and just needed
to blow off some steam.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:59.470
With the Domain fully covering the duo now,
Maki enters the ring and as she gets into

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:03.310
her pose begins to wonder what the hell is
it she isn't seeing?

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:06.590
Thinking more she starts to ponder the true
question that everyone has been thinking since

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:08.570
the introduction of Toji.

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:09.710
What is she...

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:13.990
Sensing he approaching attack, Miyo easily
manages to dart behind Maki before she can

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:18.539
grab him and as she turns to counter, instantly
ducks under her left grab.

00:18:18.539 --> 00:18:22.970
Quickly springing back up, he manages to lock
his arm perfectly around hers, then uses Maki’s

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:27.289
previous momentum to throw her over to the
edge of the ring winning the first bout.

00:18:27.289 --> 00:18:31.211
Standing above her victorious, Miyo asks Maki
if she’s got another round in her as the

00:18:31.211 --> 00:18:35.860
moment he laid eyes on her, he knew that she
was much more powerful.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:39.950
Doing like the BALLSIEST crouch ever infront
of our queen he asks what's up and to tell

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:43.360
him what's wrong, why cant she focus.

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:46.929
Its explained that Maki never relied on anybody
else to become stronger.

00:18:46.929 --> 00:18:50.750
Despite having teachers at Jujutsu High, she
has always believed in doing everything on

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:55.120
her own and being self-reliant and thats why
she just doesn't know what to say here.

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:59.480
Our smooth brain Miyo though sensed that she
was still thinking about what Daido had said

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:02.330
earlier, given her silence all this while.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:06.309
Cutting off her chain of thoughts, he asks
her to stand up and have another sumo match

00:19:06.309 --> 00:19:09.170
as thats the only way he knows how to explain
things.

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:12.492
As they continue a number of countless matches,
Miyo begins explaining to her throughout the

00:19:12.492 --> 00:19:16.280
constant bouts that she has become entangled
in it all and because of that, limited her

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.860
own progression too much.

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:21.429
She needs to instead let herself loose and
experience what it’s like to finally be

00:19:21.429 --> 00:19:23.110
free while fighting her opponents.

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:27.510
Then everything before her eye’s, like the
idea of victory of the possibility of defeat

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:32.770
will become meaningless, or in other words
exactly what the Samurai was talking about.

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:33.770
Freedom

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:38.789
Thanks to the wise words of the ancient Sumo
Goat Miyo and multitude of sumo matches, Maki

00:19:38.789 --> 00:19:43.610
finally knows what to do next all she has
to do is experience it for herself...

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:47.550
With the two beginning another bout of Sumo,
it skips forth and soon comes to an end as

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:49.770
she finishes her match with Miyo.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:53.960
Stepping out now, Maki leaves all of the others
shocked as we see our queen smiling for the

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:59.070
first time in over a decade, finally ready
to be free...

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:00.200
Having exited the domain, Daido reacts to
how much Maki’s grown within a relatively

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:01.200
short amount of time and wonders what in the
world Miyo taught her.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:04.470
Its explained that the exchanges Maki had
with Miyo hadn’t even taken 1 minute.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:08.679
Kinda like in dragon ball z with the hyperbolic
time chamber, time moves slower in Miyo’s

00:20:08.679 --> 00:20:12.820
domain and the time it takes for a 1000 sumo
bouts is less than 1 minute.

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:17.070
Fed up with all of it though, Naoya boosts
off into the sky like last time and begins

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.559
raising his speed.

00:20:18.559 --> 00:20:23.289
Looking over to the randoms, Noritoshi notices
them co-operating and asks who they are, but

00:20:23.289 --> 00:20:26.919
to his surprise they explains that it doesn't
matter who they are, others can think what

00:20:26.919 --> 00:20:27.919
they want.

00:20:27.919 --> 00:20:31.840
All they care about is the need to hold a
Katana and cut what needs to be cut or the

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:35.250
want to get back in the ring to wrestle with
Maki some more.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:39.150
Back in the battle as Naoya boosts around
destroying the city, he becomes annoyed at

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:43.400
the fact he should be overwhelming her with
speed, yet for some reason he cant even touch

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:44.400
her.

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:48.900
Sprinting across a roof, Maki see’s Naoya
shoot up and boost off infront of her, completely

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:53.790
shattering all of the glass from all the nearby
buildings as he reaches near top speed.

00:20:53.790 --> 00:21:00.299
Somehow making it over and infront of Naoya’s
trajectory, Maki drops down and begins to

00:21:00.299 --> 00:21:02.030
feel everything around her.

00:21:02.030 --> 00:21:06.940
In the past she couldn't see without glasses,
but once she gained this body thanks to Mai,

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:09.850
she became content as she was finally like
everyone else...

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:14.529
But TOJI, he wouldn't reach that height, he
would've pushed forwards without hesitation

00:21:14.529 --> 00:21:18.779
and even been able to deflect Naoya’s top
speed attacks with ease.

00:21:18.779 --> 00:21:23.890
Seeing what no one else see’s, Maki states
that its not enough to be like everyone else,

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:28.970
THERE ARE THINGS THAT ONLY THE CHOSEN ONES
LIKE TOJI AND HERSELF CAN SEE...

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:33.450
BOOM, INSTANTLY as Naoya tears through the
building directly infront of Maki, trying

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:37.779
to hit her with his top speed once more, Maki
quickly pulls herself into a ball and manages

00:21:37.779 --> 00:21:41.740
to dodge Naoya’s top speed attack in mid
air without anything to actually move off.

00:21:41.740 --> 00:21:45.840
Which is insane, a lot of the fights in this
series play off how you can catch a person

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:51.850
off guard in the sky as they’re unable to
dodge.

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:58.789
So it just goes to show Maki is literally
smoking on that NAOYA PACK RN FR

00:21:58.789 --> 00:22:02.350
Maki knows now that the air around them may
seem empty, but there are minute differences

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:07.690
in the temperature and air density, all maki
needs to do is use them to her advantage.

00:22:07.690 --> 00:22:12.120
As Naoya attempts to boost at her once again,
Maki easily dodges and punches the curse down

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:13.440
towards the ground below.

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:17.650
Maki’s also got that mega juiced up brain
as somehow she knew that Miyo was directly

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:22.030
below her allowing him to land a direct headbutt
to the side of the curses exoskeleton.

00:22:22.030 --> 00:22:28.169
Not done, Daido also reveals himself and slices
at the curse, almost completely cutting through

00:22:28.169 --> 00:22:29.390
and killing him.

00:22:29.390 --> 00:22:34.049
Coming in aswell and seemingly landing the
finishing blow, Maki kicks the back of Naoya’s

00:22:34.049 --> 00:22:37.950
curse sending his top half tumbling across
the street infront of her.

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:41.890
SCREAMING IN DENAIL OVER HIS POSSIBLE DEFEAT,
NAOYA TEARS HIS HANDS THROUGH THE SHELL OF

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:46.470
HIS CURSEWOMB FULLY REVEALING HIS HUMAN SHELL
WHILE SAYING THAT THE ONE WHO DESERVES TO

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:48.750
STAND WITH THEM IS HIMSELF.

00:22:48.750 --> 00:22:51.230
Before activating his DOMAIN EXPANSION

00:22:51.230 --> 00:22:55.559
With his domain expansion; time cell moon
palace active, we see a massive malevolent

00:22:55.559 --> 00:22:59.750
eye at the center staring directly at everyone
within its site.

00:22:59.750 --> 00:23:04.290
Instantly Naoya activates his ability on both
Miyo and Daido causing frames to erupt from

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:06.900
their bodies taking the ancient ones by surprise.

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:12.059
However even more to their surprise it disappears
allowing them to begin their attack.

00:23:12.059 --> 00:23:16.159
Though as soon as they move, both of them
drop to the ground absolutely overpowered

00:23:16.159 --> 00:23:18.500
by Naoya’s sure hit technique.

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:21.990
For anyone as confused as these old boys are,
its actually because of the fact that anyone

00:23:21.990 --> 00:23:25.870
Naoya touches has to move like him or they
freeze for 1 second.

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:29.610
What makes it all the more brutal though is
how his domain amplifies his innate technique

00:23:29.610 --> 00:23:31.000
making it even more precise.

00:23:31.000 --> 00:23:36.210
Not only this, he can even manipulate every
cell of his opponent, and when his opponent

00:23:36.210 --> 00:23:38.640
moves, every cell will be out of alignment.

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:43.960
That’s why Miyo and Daido were severely
injured just by taking one step...

00:23:43.960 --> 00:23:49.549
With Miyo collapsing to the ground, he states
that its indeed a good domain, however Naoya

00:23:49.549 --> 00:23:54.410
made his domain expansion only for Maki, but
as he tries to sense where she died he cant

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:55.490
find her.

00:23:55.490 --> 00:24:00.659
Slightly confused because this is his space,
Naoya knows she lacks cursed energy like Toji,

00:24:00.659 --> 00:24:03.760
but thought his domain would be able to locate
her.

00:24:03.760 --> 00:24:07.750
Suddenly Daido purposefully moves his right
arm in an attempt to slice Naoya only to instantly

00:24:07.750 --> 00:24:10.280
have it decapitated by an annoyed curse...

00:24:10.280 --> 00:24:15.100
You see though in typical bottom G behaviour
Naoya thought it was pointless, however Daido

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:19.720
is constructed of the same material as our
girl and was able to sense her location chucking

00:24:19.720 --> 00:24:22.260
the Katana in Maki’s direction.

00:24:22.260 --> 00:24:26.740
From within his own shadows, Maki suddenly
appears and grabs her blade before plunging

00:24:26.740 --> 00:24:29.620
it straight through her traitorous cousins
back.

00:24:29.620 --> 00:24:39.480
As we know, Maki and Toji have no cursed energy,
so they can easily enter or exit the barrier

00:24:39.480 --> 00:24:43.580
unless the barrier uses a physical object
as its shell or unless there is a specific

00:24:43.580 --> 00:24:49.250
condition placed and because Naoya didnt do
that with his Domain he cant trap her inside...

00:24:49.250 --> 00:24:53.200
Going into the twins dream world for a moment,
the sisters are able to reconcile together

00:24:53.200 --> 00:24:57.490
as they both recognize Maki finally broke
free from her curse...

00:24:57.490 --> 00:25:01.950
Correspondingly, its explained that the cursed
sword Mai left behind is the replica of the

00:25:01.950 --> 00:25:04.080
cursed tool, “Soul Liberation Blade.”

00:25:04.080 --> 00:25:10.169
That said sword and now Maki’s ignores the
hardness of everything and cuts the soul directly,

00:25:10.169 --> 00:25:14.160
but to use the full potential requires having
a pair of eyes that can see the soul of inanimate

00:25:14.160 --> 00:25:15.740
objects.

00:25:15.740 --> 00:25:20.180
Maki has achieved even this, and, in the end
as Naoya screams at her telling her she lost

00:25:20.180 --> 00:25:22.500
because she can no longer move inside of his
domain.

00:25:22.500 --> 00:25:27.649
Yet as we just covered, this domains guaranteed
hit cannot recognize Maki due to her lack

00:25:27.649 --> 00:25:34.830
of cursed energy and because of that an oblivious
Naoya is completely sliced in two, subsequently

00:25:34.830 --> 00:25:36.970
causing his domain to explode.

00:25:36.970 --> 00:25:40.799
With the battle seemingly coming to an end
and both Daido and Miyo shocked to somehow

00:25:40.799 --> 00:25:46.120
still be alive, its said that 12 years after
the death of Toji Zenin, a DEMONIC FIGHTER

00:25:46.120 --> 00:25:48.640
of equal strength was finally born...

00:25:48.640 --> 00:25:52.990
Honestly its so nice to see Maki having a
smile on her face in each panel &lt;3

00:25:52.990 --> 00:25:57.279
such a lovely change fr.

00:25:57.279 --> 00:26:12.160
Anyways gotta move forwards otherwise all
the bottom G’s cant take it, they hate it

00:26:12.160 --> 00:26:14.950
when I build up amazing female characters.

00:26:14.950 --> 00:26:20.539
So with the aftermath of Maki and Naoya’s
fight its shown that she was successful in

00:26:20.539 --> 00:26:23.610
exorcising him as Kamo confirmed her win.

00:26:23.610 --> 00:26:27.710
Maki claims that it was thanks to the randoms
that had shown up and hearing this Noritoshi

00:26:27.710 --> 00:26:29.620
asks about there condition.

00:26:29.620 --> 00:26:33.860
Just like Kamo, Daido’s and Miyo’s conditions
are also severe, but what Maki’s most concerned

00:26:33.860 --> 00:26:38.169
about, is how Noritoshi just nonchalantly
decided to throw away his life..

00:26:38.169 --> 00:26:41.299
Noritoshi though tells her that she should
know his situation, because he’s from one

00:26:41.299 --> 00:26:45.520
of the big three families like her he feels
worthless as he failed to become the head.

00:26:45.520 --> 00:26:50.309
There's also how he was named by his mother
after the most evil sorcerer in history.

00:26:50.309 --> 00:26:55.280
He asks if Maki asked hers, to which she says
she did then merked her, but now after hearing

00:26:55.280 --> 00:26:59.350
what the curse Naoya told her she doesn't
know if it was the right decision and honestly

00:26:59.350 --> 00:27:01.140
just wished they talked more.

00:27:01.140 --> 00:27:05.320
Slipping into the past, we witness a glimpse
of Kamo’s past, where he remembered his

00:27:05.320 --> 00:27:07.429
family and how his name actually originated.

00:27:07.429 --> 00:27:11.500
More or less the reason as to why she named
him Noritoshi was that it was the first thing

00:27:11.500 --> 00:27:16.700
that came to mind, she didnt know exactly
what was good for him but just wished that

